{"3098490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Monkey Mischief", "steam_appid": 3098490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Monkey Mischief. The game that has little bits of everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three game modes, with more to come in the future, that are playable in all three maps! Fly like a high speed racing car across the map with friends, climb mountains to get away from rising lava, or run from two spider-monkey twins with tentacles in a underground advanced cave system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even scale multiple trees at once, do backflips on trampolines, or explore the Mischievous Mall, where more then 30 cosmetics are for sale to wear on your physical VR character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, you can explore the Horror maps that has three upcoming levels, all scaling higher in atmosphere, and lowering your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter what you do, it's ensured you will have fun!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Monkey Mischief. The game that has little bits of everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three game modes, with more to come in the future, that are playable in all three maps! Fly like a high speed racing car across the map with friends, climb mountains to get away from rising lava, or run from two spider-monkey twins with tentacles in a underground advanced cave system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even scale multiple trees at once, do backflips on trampolines, or explore the Mischievous Mall, where more then 30 cosmetics are for sale to wear on your physical VR character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, you can explore the Horror maps that has three upcoming levels, all scaling higher in atmosphere, and lowering your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter what you do, it's ensured you will have fun!</p>", "short_description": "Monkey Mischief is a online multiplayer VR game that is dependent on the locomotion of your hands. Run to the top of the mountains when lava is rising, fly like a racing car across the map with friends, or run from two twins with tentacles in a underground advanced cave system!", "supported_languages": "English, Dutch, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Polish, Swedish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098490/header.jpg?t=1783531595", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783531595", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783531595", "website": "https://grpgames.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i7-6700 or Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 5 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 6GB or Radeon RX 580 8GB or Arc A380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> N/A<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Only supports headsets that can run the SteamVR runtime</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Re